#. Theme Name of the plugin/theme
msgid "Yoga"
msgstr "Yoga"

#. Theme URI of the plugin/theme
msgid "https://themeansar.com/themes/yoga-wordpress-theme/"
msgstr "https://themeansar.com/themes/yoga-wordpress-theme/"

#. Description of the plugin/theme
msgid ""
"Yoga could be a WordPress theme designed for Yoga or blog website. With Yoga "
"your web site is made to last and will stand out from the crowd. It comes "
"with all focus these kind of Rehabilitation, aloyoga, physiotherapist, "
"Medical Clinic, therapist, private Hospital, Sports therapy Clinic, Massage "
"therapist,Yoga, yoga, namastheyoga, . that supply Medical or therapy "
"connected services."
msgstr ""
"Yoga es un tema de WordPress diseñado para sitios web de yoga o de blog. Con "
"Yoga tu sitio web está hecho para durar y destaca entre el resto. Incluye "
"todo lo necesario para servicios de rehabilitación, fisioterapia, clínica "
"médica, terapia, hospital privado, clínica de terapia deportiva, masajista, "
"yoga y namastheyoga."

#. Author of the plugin/theme
msgid "Themeansar"
msgstr "Themeansar"

